  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot \u015Fimdi sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eimdi i\xE7in \"Y\u0131k\u0131lan Kule\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin.\n\n\u015Ea\u015F\u0131rt\u0131c\u0131
    geli\u015Fmeler ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Baz\u0131lar\u0131na
    memnun oluyor, baz\u0131lar\u0131na ise \xE7ok \u015Fa\u015F\u0131r\u0131yorsun.
    Allahtan aleyhine olan b\xFCy\xFCk bir \u015Fey yok {{isim}}. Se\xE7ti\u011Fin
    kart, normal \u015Fartlarda kay\u0131p olarak ya da y\u0131k\u0131m olarak nitelendirebilece\u011Fin
    baz\u0131 \u015Feyler ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve bunlar\u0131n senin
    i\xE7in birer \u015Fans oldu\u011Funu anlat\u0131yor. Senin alg\u0131n da bu
    y\xF6nde oldu\u011Fu i\xE7in, kay\u0131plara, yitip gidenlere ya da \"mecburen
    de\u011Fi\u015Fenlere\" \xE7ok fazla ald\u0131rm\u0131yor, arkalar\u0131ndan
    yas tutmuyor, \"daha hay\u0131rl\u0131s\u0131 i\xE7in\" oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyorsun.
    Radikal d\xF6nemler, b\xFCy\xFCk yenilikler getirir. Sanc\u0131l\u0131 da olsa,
    daha fazlas\u0131na ula\u015Fabilmek i\xE7in bazen az\u0131ndan vazge\xE7ilmelidir.
    Sen de \u015Fu an bu mantalitedesin."
